  "description": "***********************\nOPEN VIEWING\n\nTuesday - 06th October 2026 |04:00 pm – 05:00pm\n\nThursday - 8th October 2026 |04:00 pm – 05:00pm\n\nSaturday - 10th October 2026 |11:00am – 12:00pm\n\nPlease contact this number when you arrive in the building: Veryon - 089 261 7240\n\nNo booking required. Scan the QR code \nat the property to register your interest.\n\n**************************\nFIXED PRICE €370,000 - NO BIDDING\n\nApartment 15 is a bright and spacious two-bedroom apartment located on the second floor of the well-maintained Liberty View development in the heart of Dublin 8.\n\nExtending to approximately 66 sq.m, the apartment has recently been refreshed with new flooring throughout and freshly painted interiors, creating a modern and welcoming space that is ready for immediate occupation. The property is vacant and available for a quick sale.\n\nPreviously rented and well maintained, this apartment offers an ideal opportunity for both owner-occupiers and investors seeking a turnkey property in a high-demand location.\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall with storage, a bright open-plan living and dining area, fitted kitchen, a spacious primary bedroom with ensuite, a second double bedroom and a main bathroom. Large windows provide excellent natural light throughout.\n\nResidents benefit from lift access, a designated parking space and a superb city-centre location within walking distance of St. James's Hospital, the Luas Red Line, Heuston Station and a wide range of shops, cafés and restaurants.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-presented home or investment property in one of Dublin's most sought-after residential locations.\n\nFeatures\nApprox. 66 sq.m\nRecently upgraded with new flooring throughout\nFreshly painted\nVacant possession\nReady to move into\nReady to rent immediately\nTwo double bedrooms\nEnsuite bathroom\nMain bathroom\nBER B2\nDesignated parking space\nLift access\nWell-maintained development\nExcellent Dublin 8 location\nWalking distance to city centre, LUAS and St. James's Hospital\nService Charge: €2,955.58 plus €140 parking charge annually\n\n\nDisclaimer\n\nThese particulars are issued by VR Property Management on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through this office. While every care has been taken in preparing these details, VR Property Management does not hold itself responsible for any inaccuracies. All measurements are approximate, and intending purchasers are advised to satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of the information provided.",
